Uninstall Mode Selection

Choose how you want to uninstall gentle-ai:

▸ Partial Uninstall
  Select specific agents and components to remove

  Full Uninstall
  Remove all gentle-ai managed configuration from all agents

  Full Uninstall & Remove Binary
  Remove all configuration AND delete the gentle-ai binary itself
  ⚠ WARNING: This cannot be undone without reinstalling

  Full Uninstall + Clean Install
  Remove all configuration, then re-sync all managed assets from scratch

  Back

j/k: navigate • enter: select • esc: back